<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Purpose on John, Complected</title><link>https://john-nicholson.github.io/concepts/purpose/</link><description>Recent content in Purpose on John, Complected</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><copyright>© 2026</copyright><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://john-nicholson.github.io/concepts/purpose/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Remember Who You Are — The Lord Is My Shepherd</title><link>https://john-nicholson.github.io/devotionals/remember-who-you-are-the-lord-is-my-shepherd/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://john-nicholson.github.io/devotionals/remember-who-you-are-the-lord-is-my-shepherd/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Read: &#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;a class="scripture-card scripture-card--default" href="https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Joshua&amp;#43;14%3A6%E2%80%9314&amp;version=NIV" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="scripture-card__label"&gt;Scripture&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="scripture-card__reference"&gt;Joshua 14:6–14&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="scripture-card__translation"&gt;NIV&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#10;&lt;strong&gt;Read alongside: &#10;&#10;&#10;&lt;a class="scripture-card scripture-card--default" href="https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Psalm&amp;#43;23&amp;version=NIV" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="scripture-card__label"&gt;Scripture&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="scripture-card__reference"&gt;Psalm 23&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="scripture-card__translation"&gt;NIV&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;There is something powerful about looking back and seeing how faithfully God has led you.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;There are seasons when the path has been clear and seasons when it has not. There are prayers that were answered quickly and others that took years. There are moments of joy, disappointment, waiting, change and unexpected blessing.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;And through all of it, &lt;strong&gt;God has been faithful&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>